<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIA 159-4 AT TEA V SOUTH AFRICA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 159-4 AT TEA V SOUTH AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>AHMEDABAD, India 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 159 for four</p>
<p>at tea on the opening day of the first test against South Africa</p>
<p>on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
